<a name="toc_tc30353"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P233-94: ProductService Validator Integration Test - Add valid product&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
